# contrast-audit writes a same-origin wrapper into the docroot; cleaned up on exit, but a
# killed run can leave one behind. Never commit them.
__ca_*.html
__*.html

# INTERNAL WORKING FILES — never publish. This repo IS the live site: anything
# committed here is fetchable at arpitmaheshwari.com/<path> and, because the repo
# is public, readable on github.com too. These hold NDA client identities, private
# rulings and unshipped drafts. Untracked 2026-08-16 after an audit found all of
# them returning HTTP 200 on the live domain.
CANONICAL-FACTS.md
DESIGN-SYSTEM.md
DESIGN-SYSTEM-EMBER.md
NARRATIVE-FRAMEWORKS.md
Arpit Maheshwari - Folio & Case Studies.docx
prototypes/

# Playwright: dependencies and run artifacts are disposable; the SNAPSHOT
# baselines are not — they are the contract a refactor must satisfy, so they
# stay tracked.
tests/pw/node_modules/
tests/pw/test-results/
tests/pw/playwright-report/
# The baselines are 62MB of PNGs. This repo IS the published site — anything
# committed here is served from arpitmaheshwari.com, so test screenshots would
# be both repo bloat and public artifacts on a job-search domain. They stay
# local; regenerate with `npx playwright test --update-snapshots`.
tests/pw/visual.spec.js-snapshots/
